WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.256
This is the room where I sleep.

2
00:00:04.257 --> 00:00:13.140
I sleep in the bedroom.

3
00:00:13.141 --> 00:00:16.724
This is the room where I brush my teeth.

4
00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:26.328
I brush my teeth in the bathroom.

5
00:00:26.329 --> 00:00:29.229
This is the room where I cook.

6
00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:37.752
I cook in the kitchen.

7
00:00:37.753 --> 00:00:40.736
This is the room where I eat.

8
00:00:40.737 --> 00:00:50.321
I eat in the dining room.

9
00:00:50.322 --> 00:00:54.657
This is the room where I talk with my family.

10
00:00:54.658 --> 00:01:05.404
I talk with my family in the living room.

11
00:01:05.405 --> 00:01:09.394
This is the area where we park our car.

12
00:01:09.395 --> 00:01:19.589
We park the car in the garage.

13
00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:22.831
This is the area where I play.

14
00:01:22.832 --> 00:01:32.156
I play in the yard.

15
00:01:32.157 --> 00:01:36.109
This is my house, where I live with my family.

16
00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:42.015
"Home sweet home!"

